  <h2>Strong on the Go, Too: 91 out of 100 Points on Your Smartphone</h2>

  <p>
    On mobile devices, connections on the go are often unreliable and smartphones have less computing power than a desktop computer. That is exactly why we fine-tuned the mobile version – and it paid off: in the latest Google test, mobile performance rises from 89 to 91 points, putting it firmly in the green zone.
  </p>

